---
const currentYear = 2026;
---

<footer class="border-t border-slate-800/80 bg-[#070a12] py-14 text-slate-400 text-xs">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-10 mb-12">
      
      <!-- Brand & Description -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <img src="/agnes-icon.png" alt="Agnes Logo" class="w-8 h-8 object-contain" />
          <span class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Agnes</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-slate-400">Open Source</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 max-w-md leading-relaxed">
          Aplicación de escritorio de uso público diseñada para estructurar protocolos académicos oficiales para la <strong>Universidad de Cartagena</strong>, garantizando el aprendizaje activo del estudiante a través de evaluaciones interactivas impulsadas por IA.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-400 text-xs pt-1">
          <span>Desarrollado por <a href="https://github.com/Richard-zip" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white hover:text-indigo-400 font-semibold underline underline-offset-4">Richard-zip</a></span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span class="text-emerald-400 font-medium">Licencia MIT</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Links -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white">Recursos</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/Richard-zip/Agnes" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span>Repositorio en GitHub</span>
              <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-slate-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path></svg>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/Richard-zip/Agnes/releases" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span>Releases y Versiones</span>
              <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-slate-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path></svg>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/Richard-zip/Agnes/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span>Reportar un problema</span>
              <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-slate-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path></svg>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span>Google AI Studio (API Key)</span>
              <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-slate-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path></svg>
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Legal / Academic Notice -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white">Aviso Académico</h4>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Los formatos de tablas y encabezados corresponden a los estándares pedagógicos de la <strong>Universidad de Cartagena</strong>. Este software no está afiliado oficialmente a la institución y se ofrece como herramienta de estudio comunitaria.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Bar -->
    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-slate-900 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-[11px] text-slate-500">
      <div>
        © {currentYear} Agnes. Desarrollado con ❤️ para la comunidad académica por <a href="https://github.com/Richard-zip" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-white">Richard-zip</a>.
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span>Software Libre y Gratuito</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>Código disponible en GitHub</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
